-- Timesheets and time tracking (FR-TS-001..006, 009, 011..013), ADR 008.
-- Merges the daily draft_timesheets rows (ADR 003) into timesheets + timesheet_days. The old
-- table is kept, renamed and closed to the app, until the merge is verified; it is dropped in a
-- later migration (no data is deleted here).

